  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0\nBREAKING: SignalRaised event removed - use Subscribe() instead\nBREAKING: .NET 6.0/7.0 removed - minimum is .NET 8.0\n\nNEW: Detection Ledger System for evidence accumulation\n- DetectionLedger aggregates detector contributions with sigmoid function\n- DetectionContribution with factory methods (Bot, Human, VerifiedBot, etc.)\n- CategoryScore breakdown for explainability\n- IEntityLedger generic interface for any entity type\n- LedgerSignal with salience and provenance metadata\n\nNEW: Lock-free Signal Subscription\n- sink.Subscribe(handler) returns IDisposable\n- Pattern-based forwarding: errorSink.SubscribeToPattern(mainSink, \"error.*\")\n\nNEW: WindowSizeAtom for dynamic capacity management via signals\nSECURITY: Patched System.Text.Json and Npgsql vulnerabilities\nPERF: Bounded cleanup iteration prevents degradation under load",
